{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":68,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["To the chief Musician, A Psalm ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["or"]}," Song of David. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 68:1"},"Let God arise, let his enemies be scattered: let them also that hate him flee before him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 68:2"},"As smoke is driven away, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["so"]}," drive ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["them"]}," away: as wax melteth before the fire, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["so"]}," let the wicked perish at the presence of God. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 68:3"},"But let the righteous be glad; let them rejoice before God: yea, let them exceedingly rejoice. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 68:4"},"Sing unto God, sing praises to his name: extol him that rideth upon the heavens by his name JAH, and rejoice before him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 68:5"},"A father of the fatherless, and a judge of the widows, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is "]},"God in his holy habitation. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 68:6"},"God setteth the solitary in families: he bringeth out those which are bound with chains: but the rebellious dwell in a dry ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["land."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 68:7"},"O God, when thou wentest forth before thy people, when thou didst march through the wilderness; Selah: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 68:8"},"The earth shook, the heavens also dropped at the presence of God: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," Sinai itself ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was moved"]}," at the presence of God, the God of Israel. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 68:9"},"Thou, O God, didst send a plentiful rain, whereby thou didst confirm thine inheritance, when it was weary. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 68:10"},"Thy congregation hath dwelt therein: thou, O God, hast prepared of thy goodness for the poor. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 68:11"},"The Lord gave the word: great ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["was"]}," the company of those that published ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 68:12"},"Kings of armies did flee apace: and she that tarried at home divided the spoil. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:12"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PSA 68:13"},"Though ye have lien among the pots, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["yet shall ye be as"]}," the wings of a dove covered with silver, and her feathers with yellow gold. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:13"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PSA 68:14"},"When the Almighty scattered kings in it, it was ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["white"]}," as snow in Salmon. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:14"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PSA 68:15"},"The hill of God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is as"]}," the hill of Bashan; an high hill ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as"]}," the hill of Bashan. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:15"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PSA 68:16"},"Why leap ye, ye high hills? ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["this is"]}," the hill ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which "]},"God desireth to dwell in; yea, the LORD will dwell ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["in it "]},"for ever. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:16"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PSA 68:17"},"The chariots of God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," twenty thousand, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," thousands of angels: the Lord ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," among them, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as in"]}," Sinai, in the holy ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["place."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:17"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PSA 68:18"},"Thou hast ascended on high, thou hast led captivity captive: thou hast received gifts for men; yea, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," the rebellious also, that the LORD God might dwell ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["among them."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:18"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PSA 68:19"},"Blessed ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["be"]}," the Lord, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["who"]}," daily loadeth us ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["with benefits, even"]}," the God of our salvation. Selah. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:19"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PSA 68:20"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["He that is"]}," our God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the God of salvation; and unto God the Lord ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["belong"]}," the issues from death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:20"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PSA 68:21"},"But God shall wound the head of his enemies, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," the hairy scalp of such an one as goeth on still in his trespasses. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:21"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PSA 68:22"},"The Lord said, I will bring again from Bashan, I will bring ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["my people"]}," again from the depths of the sea: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:22"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PSA 68:23"},"That thy foot may be dipped in the blood of ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["thine"]}," enemies, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," the tongue of thy dogs in the same. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:23"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PSA 68:24"},"They have seen thy goings, O God; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," the goings of my God, my King, in the sanctuary. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:24"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PSA 68:25"},"The singers went before, the players on instruments ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["followed "]},"after; among ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["them were"]}," the damsels playing with timbrels. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:25"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PSA 68:26"},"Bless ye God in the congregations, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," the Lord, from the fountain of Israel. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:26"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PSA 68:27"},"There ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," little Benjamin ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["with"]}," their ruler, the princes of Judah ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," their council, the princes of Zebulun, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," the princes of Naphtali. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:27"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PSA 68:28"},"Thy God hath commanded thy strength: strengthen, O God, that which thou hast wrought for us. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:28"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PSA 68:29"},"Because of thy temple at Jerusalem shall kings bring presents unto thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:29"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"PSA 68:30"},"Rebuke the company of spearmen, the multitude of the bulls, with the calves of the people, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["till every one"]}," submit himself with pieces of silver: scatter thou the people ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," delight in war. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:30"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"31","sid":"PSA 68:31"},"Princes shall come out of Egypt; Ethiopia shall soon stretch out her hands unto God. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:31"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"32","sid":"PSA 68:32"},"Sing unto God, ye kingdoms of the earth; O sing praises unto the Lord; Selah: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:32"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"33","sid":"PSA 68:33"},"To him that rideth upon the heavens of heavens, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which were "]},"of old; lo, he doth send out his voice, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and that"]}," a mighty voice. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:33"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"34","sid":"PSA 68:34"},"Ascribe ye strength unto God: his excellency ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," over Israel, and his strength ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," in the clouds. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:34"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"35","sid":"PSA 68:35"},"O God, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["thou art"]}," terrible out of thy holy places: the God of Israel ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," he that giveth strength and power unto ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his "]},"people. Blessed ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["be"]}," God. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 68:35"}]}]}
